WEBVTT

00:00:08.315 --> 00:00:11.395
(COUGHS) Wow. Dusty.

00:00:12.195 --> 00:00:14.355
The mask. Where's the mask?

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:17.315
No! The mask! Get it!

00:00:17.395 --> 00:00:19.355
Get the mask! Get it!

00:00:20.795 --> 00:00:22.515
(PANTS)

00:00:24.635 --> 00:00:26.635
(DORY SINGS TO SELF)

00:00:26.715 --> 00:00:28.395
Whoo-hoo!

00:00:29.515 --> 00:00:31.115
Keeps going on, doesn't it?

00:00:31.195 --> 00:00:33.035
Echo! Echo!

00:00:33.875 --> 00:00:36.155
-What are you doing?
-I've lost the mask.

00:00:36.235 --> 00:00:38.155
-Did you drop it?
-You dropped it!

00:00:38.235 --> 00:00:40.835
That was my only chance of
finding my son. Now it's gone.

00:00:44.995 --> 00:00:47.195
Hey, Mr. Grumpy Gills.

00:00:48.635 --> 00:00:51.155
-When you're down, know what to do?
-I don't want to know.

00:00:51.235 --> 00:00:53.555
Just keep swimming.

00:00:53.635 --> 00:00:56.235
♪ Just keep swimming,
swimming, swimming

00:00:56.355 --> 00:00:58.595
♪ What do we do? We swim

00:00:58.675 --> 00:01:00.395
Dory, no singing.

00:01:01.115 --> 00:01:03.195
♪ I love to swim

00:01:03.275 --> 00:01:06.835
♪ And when you want to swim
you want to... ♪

00:01:06.915 --> 00:01:09.915
I'm going to get stuck with that song.
It's in my head!

00:01:09.995 --> 00:01:11.155
DORY: Sorry.

00:01:13.235 --> 00:01:15.315
MARLIN: See anything?
DORY: Something's got me!

00:01:15.395 --> 00:01:17.315
-That was me. Sorry.
-Who's that?

00:01:17.395 --> 00:01:19.675
Who could it be? It's me.

00:01:19.755 --> 00:01:22.395
DORY: Are... Are you my conscience?

00:01:23.475 --> 00:01:25.635
MARLIN: Yeah. I'm your conscience.

00:01:25.715 --> 00:01:28.475
We haven't spoken for a while.
How are you?

00:01:28.595 --> 00:01:30.675
-Can't complain.
-Good.

00:01:30.755 --> 00:01:34.195
Now, Dory, I want you to tell me,
do you see anything?

00:01:34.315 --> 00:01:36.155
I see a...

00:01:37.075 --> 00:01:38.675
-I see a light.
-A light?

00:01:38.755 --> 00:01:40.875
Yeah. Over there.

00:01:40.955 --> 00:01:42.675
Hey, conscience, am I dead?

00:01:42.755 --> 00:01:44.275
I see it, too.

00:01:51.795 --> 00:01:53.275
What is it?

00:01:54.035 --> 00:01:56.715
It's so pretty!

00:01:58.595 --> 00:02:00.035
I...

00:02:00.115 --> 00:02:02.355
I'm feeling happy.

00:02:03.515 --> 00:02:06.875
Which is a big deal for me.

00:02:06.955 --> 00:02:08.675
I want to touch it.

00:02:09.955 --> 00:02:12.395
Hey, come back. Come on back here.

00:02:12.475 --> 00:02:14.275
I'm going to get you.

00:02:14.635 --> 00:02:16.195
I'm going to get you.

00:02:16.315 --> 00:02:18.115
♪ I'm going to swim with you

00:02:18.195 --> 00:02:20.995
♪ I'm going to be your best friend ♪

00:02:21.075 --> 00:02:22.435
Good feeling's gone.

00:02:26.995 --> 00:02:28.715
(THEY SCREAM)

00:02:29.795 --> 00:02:31.995
I can't see.
I don't know where I'm going.

00:02:33.995 --> 00:02:35.915
-The mask!
-What mask?

00:02:37.115 --> 00:02:39.155
Okay. I can't see a thing.

00:02:39.955 --> 00:02:40.955
Whoa, geez.

00:02:41.035 --> 00:02:43.115
-Look. A mask.
-Read it!

00:02:44.235 --> 00:02:48.155
I'm sorry, but if you could bring it
a little closer. I need the light.

00:02:48.235 --> 00:02:50.355
That's great. Keep it right there.

00:02:50.475 --> 00:02:53.235
-Just read it!
-Okay, okay.

00:02:53.315 --> 00:02:54.835
Mr. Bossy.

00:02:55.675 --> 00:02:57.355
"P." Okay. P.

00:02:57.475 --> 00:02:58.995
"Sher..."

00:02:59.835 --> 00:03:01.715
P. Sher... P. Shirley...

00:03:01.795 --> 00:03:03.275
P not Shirley.

00:03:04.515 --> 00:03:06.395
The first line's "P. Sherman."

00:03:06.475 --> 00:03:09.035
"P. Sherman" doesn't make any sense!

00:03:09.155 --> 00:03:10.475
Second line.

00:03:10.555 --> 00:03:12.155
"42..."

00:03:15.035 --> 00:03:16.955
DORY: Light, please.

00:03:17.035 --> 00:03:20.595
"Walla... Wallaby."

00:03:23.235 --> 00:03:25.755
The second line's "42 Wallaby Way."

00:03:25.835 --> 00:03:28.915
Just finish up. Speed read.
No pressure.

00:03:28.995 --> 00:03:31.955
There's a lot of pressure!
Take a guess, with pressure.

00:03:32.035 --> 00:03:34.515
-Sydney. It's Sydney!
-Duck!

00:03:38.115 --> 00:03:40.635
MARLIN: (PANTS) I'm dead. I'm dead.

00:03:40.715 --> 00:03:42.515
I died. I'm dead.

00:03:49.275 --> 00:03:50.275
Whoo-hoo!

00:03:50.795 --> 00:03:52.435
♪ We did it, we did it

00:03:52.515 --> 00:03:54.155
♪ Oh, yeah, yeah, yeah

00:03:54.235 --> 00:03:57.435
♪ No eating here tonight,
eating here tonight

00:03:57.515 --> 00:04:00.275
♪ No eating here tonight
You're on a diet ♪

00:04:00.355 --> 00:04:03.195
Dory. What did it say?
What did the mask say?

00:04:03.275 --> 00:04:05.835
P. Sherman,
42 Wallaby Way, Sydney. (GASPS)

00:04:05.915 --> 00:04:09.315
I remembered what it said!
I forget things, but I remembered it.

00:04:09.395 --> 00:04:11.395
-P. Sherman...
-Where is that?

00:04:11.475 --> 00:04:14.075
I don't know. But who cares?
I remembered.

00:04:15.595 --> 00:04:19.235
P. Sherman, 42 Wallaby Way, Sydney.
I remembered it again!

00:04:46.315 --> 00:04:47.595
Psst!

00:04:48.475 --> 00:04:49.955
(WHISPERS) Nemo.

00:04:50.875 --> 00:04:52.635
Nemo!

00:04:53.835 --> 00:04:54.875
Huh?

00:04:54.955 --> 00:04:55.955
Suivez-moi.

00:04:58.395 --> 00:04:59.835
Follow me.

00:05:16.115 --> 00:05:18.635
(POLYNESIAN-TYPE CHANTING)

00:05:54.515 --> 00:05:55.515
Hoo!

00:05:57.795 --> 00:05:59.115
State your name.

00:06:00.155 --> 00:06:01.195
Nemo.

00:06:01.675 --> 00:06:03.675
Brother Bloat, proceed.

00:06:05.275 --> 00:06:08.675
Nemo, newcomer of orange and white.

00:06:08.915 --> 00:06:13.155
You have been called forth to the
summit of Mount Wannahockaloogie

00:06:13.235 --> 00:06:17.955
to join with us
in the fraternal bonds of tankhood.

00:06:18.635 --> 00:06:19.635
Huh?

00:06:19.715 --> 00:06:22.035
-We want you in our club, kid.
-Really?

00:06:22.115 --> 00:06:25.875
If you are able to swim through

00:06:25.955 --> 00:06:29.515
the Ring of Fire!

00:06:33.555 --> 00:06:36.955
Turn on the Ring of Fire.
You said you could do it.

00:06:37.035 --> 00:06:38.835
The Ring of Fire!

00:06:39.555 --> 00:06:40.555
(CHANTING RESUMES)

00:06:41.235 --> 00:06:43.075
Bubbles. Let me...

00:06:50.915 --> 00:06:53.755
Isn't there another way? He's just a boy.

00:06:57.755 --> 00:06:58.755
(CHANTING SPEEDS UP)

00:07:04.915 --> 00:07:09.195
From this moment on,
you will now be known as Sharkbait.

00:07:09.275 --> 00:07:10.635
Sharkbait! Oo-ha-ha!

00:07:10.715 --> 00:07:12.395
Welcome, Brother Sharkbait.

00:07:12.475 --> 00:07:13.675
Sharkbait.

00:07:13.755 --> 00:07:16.555
-Enough with the Sharkbait.
-Sharkbait, oo...

00:07:17.715 --> 00:07:19.915
-Sharkbait's one of us now.
-Agreed.

00:07:19.995 --> 00:07:23.475
We can't send him to his death.
Darla's coming in five days.

00:07:23.555 --> 00:07:25.075
So what are we going to do?

00:07:26.275 --> 00:07:28.035
I'll tell you.

00:07:28.115 --> 00:07:30.795
We're going to get him out of here.
We'll help him escape.

00:07:30.875 --> 00:07:33.315
-Escape? Really?
-We're all going to escape.

00:07:33.595 --> 00:07:36.035
Not another one of your escape plans.

00:07:36.115 --> 00:07:38.115
Sorry, but they never work.

00:07:38.195 --> 00:07:39.675
Yeah, why should this be any different?

00:07:40.155 --> 00:07:43.155
-'Cause we've got him.
-Me?

00:07:43.235 --> 00:07:44.915
-You see that filter?
-Yeah.

00:07:45.195 --> 00:07:48.715
You're the only one who can
get in and out of that thing.

00:07:48.795 --> 00:07:52.995
We need you to take a pebble
inside there and jam the gears.

00:07:53.075 --> 00:07:56.875
You do that and this tank's going to
get filthier by the minute.

00:07:56.955 --> 00:07:59.595
Soon the dentist
will have to clean the tank.

00:07:59.675 --> 00:08:03.835
When he does, he'll take us out of
the tank, put us in individual baggies,

00:08:03.915 --> 00:08:06.835
then we'll roll down the counter,
out of the window,

00:08:06.955 --> 00:08:10.395
off the awning, into the bushes,
across the street and into the harbor.

00:08:11.635 --> 00:08:13.115
It's foolproof.

00:08:13.635 --> 00:08:16.155
-Who's with me?
-I.

00:08:16.235 --> 00:08:18.115
-I think you're nuts.
-(SIGHS)

00:08:18.475 --> 00:08:21.395
No offense, kid,
but you're not the best swimmer.

00:08:21.475 --> 00:08:24.235
He's fine. He can do this.

00:08:24.315 --> 00:08:27.435
So, Sharkbait, what do you think?

00:08:27.555 --> 00:08:28.995
Let's do it!

